        "TileImage": "$($repository 7d28ed81-2b13-4a8f-8276-0216c5e8058d).Image",
        "Description": "今回はターゲット達を180階の高さから転落死をさせろという依頼だ\r誰にも見つかることなく、また誰も気絶させてはならない\r健闘を祈る\r\rThis time, the contract is to make the targets fall to their deaths from the 180th floor.\rYou must not knock anyone out, and you must not let anyone find you.\rGood luck.",
